-- ============================================================================
-- Performance: RLS initPlan optimization (auth_rls_initplan advisory)
--
-- Wraps every direct auth.uid() / current_setting() call inside RLS policy
-- expressions in a scalar subquery: (SELECT auth.uid()). Postgres then treats
-- it as an initPlan and evaluates it ONCE per statement instead of once per
-- row. Semantically identical (auth.uid() is constant for a statement); this is
-- Supabase's official remediation. Generated from live policy definitions via
-- ALTER POLICY, so roles, commands and all other clauses are preserved.
--
-- Applies to all tenants (RLS is global) and all current/future signups.
-- 157 policies across 64 tables. Idempotent: re-running is a no-op.
-- ============================================================================

